      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Video v4 (two loops)\n**Topic form → Gemini writes ALL scenes**\n\n**Loop 1 (images):** per scene: edit image prompt → Cloudflare image → save → check\n**Loop 2 (voices):** per scene: edit voice script → Cloudflare voice (WAV) → save → FFmpeg to MP3 → FFmpeg merge image + MP3 → clip → check\n**End:** all clips joined into one video.\n\n**Before starting n8n (same window):**\n`set NODES_EXCLUDE=[]`\n`set N8N_RESTRICT_FILE_ACCESS_TO=C:/temp`\n`npx n8n`\n\nFill keys, `base_dir` and `ffmpeg_path` in **Config**. In edit forms, leave a box empty to keep the text.",
